| Ownership | 4 | `admit` is live. `grant.py` is not. Four Mouth bundle callers. |
| Coupling | 5 | Domain does not import FastAPI. Engines lazy-import `db`. |
| Cohesion | 6 | Locked Engines are one-job. `db.py` is not. |
| Dependency direction | 4 | Shells own rules. Domain is optional. |

### Code quality

| Sub-dimension | Score | Why |
|---|---|---|
| Duplication | 4 | Competing formulas for Tool Grant, Outcome (pinned by test), money, Channel, Mouth LLM. |
