### Security

| Sub-dimension | Score | Why |
|---|---|---|
| Auth | 4 | Best-engineered registry in the repo; shipped off; `ROLE_DEFAULTS` restore; no OIDC/session. Frontend has no route guards. |
| Secrets | 4 | Full `.env` mounted to every compose service. `SKILL_PLATFORM_KEY` ships a committed constant (`.env.example:326`). Log-path PII redact never runs. |
| Injection | 8 | Bound `text()` parameters; no `pickle` / `yaml.load` / `eval` / `shell=True` production sinks found. WhatsApp/payment HMAC fail-closed. Twilio signature optional off-prod. |
| Dependencies | 3 | Frontend lockfile + integrity hashes. Backend: **no lockfile**. Product CI: **no SCA**. Habibi `bun.lock` is a second lockfile. |

