| Idempotency | 3 | Primitive exists (`db.py:686-736`); dials unused; wrap-up key includes `Date.now()`. |
| Failure isolation | 5 | Process split is real. Live Mouth and Twilio never enter the breaker. `bot_worker` has no healthcheck. |

