## What already holds (do not re-open)

Copy these; do not invent an eighth formula.

| Seam | Evidence |
|---|---|
| Staff authz totality | `authz.ROUTE_PERMISSIONS` + `assert_registry_covers` (`test_authz.py:38-40`) |
| Contact Gate (live callers) | `contact_policy.admit` on outbound, cadence, campaigns, treatment, WhatsApp, payments |
| Authority Locked Engine | `decide()` refusals in `test_authority_engine.py` |
| WhatsApp double-send reasoning | `whatsapp.py:201-244`, `whatsapp_outbound.py:293-328` |
| Speech REST retry | `azure_speech.py:373-457` |
| Idempotency primitive | `db.py:686-736` + tenant-scoped PK |
| Commit-then-carrier | cadence, campaigns, WA outbound, webhook dispatch |
| SKIP LOCKED + reclaim | bot jobs, WA outbound, webhooks |
| `platform_switches.KNOWN_KEYS` | absence = off; typos 404 |
| Frontend mock fail-closed in prod | `Habibi/src/api/config.ts:11-19` |
| `money_inr` leaf | no repo imports |
| MCP out of the API process | `mcp_server.py` not in compose (status fiction is the defect, not the split) |
| Compile Gates G0–G15 + G-OB\* | `compile.py` |
| Voice call trace | `voice/call_trace.py` at WARNING, on purpose |

